---
// Viewport Digital LLC - Agency Landing Page
// Stack: Astro, Tailwind CSS, Vercel
---

<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Viewport Digital LLC | High-Performance Web Infrastructure & Media</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Custom high-performance web applications and commercial media out of Carmel, Indiana." />
	</head>
	<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-slate-800 selection:text-white">

		<!-- Utility / Sticky Header Bar -->
		<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-md bg-slate-950/80 border-b border-slate-800/80">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
				<a href="/" class="font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-lg uppercase">
					Viewport Digital <span class="text-slate-400 font-normal">LLC</span>
				</a>
				<nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
					<a href="#services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a>
					<a href="#stack" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Architecture</a>
					<a href="#work" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Work</a>
				</nav>
				<div>
					<a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white text-slate-950 font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors shadow-sm">
						Inquire Now
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main>
			<!-- Hero Section: Star of the Show -->
			<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-32 lg:pt-36 lg:pb-40">
				<!-- Radial Background Gradient Mask for Tactile Depth -->
				<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-indigo-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">
					<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300 mb-8 font-mono">
						<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
						Based in Carmel, Indiana[span_1](start_span)[span_1](end_span)
					</div>

					<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white mb-8">
						Code. Capture. Convert.
					</h1>

					<div class="max-w-[650px] mx-auto">
						<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300/90 leading-[1.6] mb-10">
							We build high-performance web infrastructure and commercial media for brands that refuse to blend in. Zero database bloat. Pure speed.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
						<a href="#contact" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-950 font-bold tracking-tight hover:bg-slate-200 transition-all shadow-lg">
							Start Your Build
						</a>
						<a href="#services" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all">
							Explore Services
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Services Section: Granular Breakdown -->
			<section id="services" class="py-24 border-t border-slate-900 bg-slate-900/30">
				<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
					<div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
							Engineered for Impact.
						</h2>
						<p class="text-slate-400 text-base leading-[1.5]">
							Every digital property and visual asset is crafted to eliminate friction and drive measurable outcomes.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
						<!-- Card 1 -->
						<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
							<div>
								<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-6 font-mono font-bold">
									01
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Custom Web Apps</h3>
								<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-[1.6] mb-6">
									High-performance static architecture via Astro and Vercel[span_2](start_span)[span_2](end_span). Blazing fast load times, rigid security, and bulletproof responsive layouts.
								</p>
							</div>
							<span class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Growth & Pro Tiers</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Card 2 -->
						<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
							<div>
								<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-6 font-mono font-bold">
									02
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Commercial Media</h3>
								<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-[1.6] mb-6">
									Sharp, deliberate brand assets and corporate imagery engineered to elevate your digital footprint and capture consumer attention instantly.
								</p>
							</div>
							<span class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Brand & Product Assets</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Card 3 -->
						<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
							<div>
								<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-6 font-mono font-bold">
									03
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Events & Portraits</h3>
								<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-[1.6] mb-6">
									Clean, professional individual and special event photography focused on authentic storytelling without the awkward staging.
								</p>
							</div>
							<span class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Direct Booking</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Contact / CTA Section -->
			<section id="contact" class="py-24 border-t border-slate-900">
				<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
					<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
						Let's Build Your Digital Footprint.
					</h2>
					<p class="text-slate-400 text-base leading-[1.5] mb-10 max-w-[600px] mx-auto">
						Reach out directly to kick off your project build or schedule a media session.
					</p>

					<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 text-left">
						<form action="https://formspree.io/f/your-endpoint" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
							<div>
								<label class="block text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">Your Name</label>
								<input type="text" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 transition-colors" placeholder="Jane Doe" />
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="block text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">Email Address</label>
								<input type="email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 transition-colors" placeholder="jane@company.com" />
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="block text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">Project Scope</label>
								<textarea name="message" rows="4" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 transition-colors" placeholder="Tell us about your web build or media needs..."></textarea>
							</div>
							<button type="submit" class="w-full py-4 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-950 font-bold tracking-tight hover:bg-slate-200 transition-all shadow-md">
								Submit Inquiry
							</button>
						</form>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="border-t border-slate-900 py-12">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
				<p>&copy; 2026 Viewport Digital LLC. All rights reserved[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span).</p>
				<p class="font-mono text-xs">kiimon@viewportdigitalmedia.com</p>
			</div>
		</footer>

	</body>
</html>
